  "title": "페타치즈랑 렌틸콩이랑 퀴노아만 있으면 돼요  (All I Need Is Feta Cheese, Lentils, and Quinoa)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "cindy": "신디",
    "seungchan": "백승찬",
